  "job_B3.2.1_20251003_114610": {
    "text": "To middanwintra.\nOstende nobis Domine.\nHer seg\u00f0 \u00feis halige godspel be \u00fe\u00e6re hean medomnesse \u00feisse halgan tide \u00fee nu onweard is, & us l\u00e6re\u00f0\nFor\u00feam se arf\u00e6sta f\u00e6der ne wolde l\u00e6tan his gesceaft forweor\u00f0an \u00fea\u00fee he to his agenre anlicnesse\nSwa sanctus Lucas se godspellere be \u00fean wrat & cw\u00e6\u00f0: In \u00fea tiid w\u00e6s mycel gemot gebannen fram\n\u00de\u00e6t gewrit w\u00e6s \u00e6rest ongunnen fram \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e gerefan \u00fee Syria hatte, \u00fe\u00e6s mannes nama w\u00e6s\n& \u00fea eodon ealle, anra gehwylc on his ceastre, \u00fe\u00e6tte hie onfengon \u00feam bebode \u00fee \u00fea gebannen w\u00e6s\n\u00dea ferde se eadga Ioseph fram Galilea, of \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre \u00fee Nazaret hatte, to Dauides ceastre sio is\n\u00dea hie \u00fea to Bethlem comon, w\u00e6ron \u00fea \u00f0a dagas gefylled \u00fe\u00e6t hio bearn cennan sceolde.\n& \u00fea cende hio sunu, hire frumbearn, on \u00feas niht \u00fee nu toniht w\u00e6s, & hio mid cla\u00f0um hine bewand &\nOn \u00feam ilcan lande on \u00fea niht w\u00e6ron hyrdas w\u00e6ccende & hioldon \u00fea w\u00e6ccan \u00fe\u00e6re nihte ofer hiora\n\u00dea com him to dryhtnes engel & bi him gestod & hie ymbscan godcundes leohtes byrhto.\n\u00dea w\u00e6ron \u00fea hyrdas swi\u00f0e forhtiende mid mycle egsan & hie him swi\u00f0e ondredon.\nSe engel hie \u00fea frefrede & swa cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne forhtia\u00f0 ge, ne eow ondr\u00e6da\u00fe.\nFor\u00fey ic eow secge mycelne gefean, se bi\u00f0 eallum folcum gefea, for\u00fean\u00fee eow tod\u00e6g is h\u00e6lend\n& ic eow secge \u00fe\u00e6tte ge meta\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t cild on cla\u00f0um bewunden & on binne aseted.\n\u00d0a w\u00e6s sona \u00e6fter \u00fean wordum mid \u00feam engle heofonlices herges m\u00e6ngeo, hergende God & swa\nNu we gehyrdon on \u00feyssum godspelles segenum \u00fe\u00e6tte Agustus se casere, se w\u00e6s nemned o\u00f0re naman\nOn \u00fean w\u00e6s getacnod \u00fe\u00e6t he com on menniscum lichoman se \u00f0e be him sylfum \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Data est\nEft he cw\u00e6\u00f0 be his mihte: C\u00e6lum et terram ego impleo. Ic gefylle heofon & eor\u00fean.\n& \u00fea swa w\u00e6s woruldbebod gebannen fram Aguste \u00feam casere swa w\u00e6s eft \u00e6fter \u00feam Cristes bebod\n& hira lar w\u00e6s ges\u00e6d geond ealne middangeard to eor\u00f0an gem\u00e6rum, swa him Crist bebead \u00fe\u00e6t hie\nSwa \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t Agustus se casere he ricsode \u00e6r Cristes cyme ofer ealne middangeard, swa ure\nManegu wundor gelumpon in Agustes rice.\n\u00deurh \u00fea wundor w\u00e6s getacnod Cristes cyme on middangeard.\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s sum \u00feara wundra \u00fea se casere com to Rome mid sigef\u00e6ste gefean & mid blisse, \u00f0a \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re\n& on \u00feam hringe w\u00e6s getacnod \u00fe\u00e6t on his rice acenned wolde bion se \u00e6\u00f0eling se is rihtlice nemned\n\u00de\u00e6t gelomp swa ilce \u00fe\u00e6t se casere on his rice forgeaf ealle scylda Romwara folce.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s on \u00fean getacnod \u00fe\u00e6t on his rice wolde cuman on middangeard se \u00f0e mancynne forgifan wolde\nOnd on \u00fe\u00e6s caseres dagum w\u00e6ron genydde to rihtum \u00feeowdome & to rihtre hyrnesse ealle \u00fea esnas \u00fee\n& on \u00feam w\u00e6s \u00fea getacnod \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurh Cristes lare mancynn sceolde bion under\u00feeoded anes Godes\n& in Agustes dagum wear\u00f0 swa mycel sybb geworden on middangearde \u00fe\u00e6t men w\u00e6pn ne w\u00e6gon,\n& he eac sende his cempan wide geond manega m\u00e6g\u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6tte yfle men ne dorston nanwyht to teonan\nIn \u00fe\u00e6re myclan sybbe w\u00e6s getacnod \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0an sybbe cyme in middangeard, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s ure h\u00e6lend\n\u00d0rim wisum ungelice w\u00e6ron mannum beboden on \u00fe\u00e6s caseres dagum, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ghwylc man\nOn \u00fean w\u00e6s getacnod \u00fe\u00e6t we sculon in \u00ferim wisum Gode rihtes geleafan gaful agildan, \u00fe\u00e6t is on\nSwa se eadega Paulus be \u00fean cw\u00e6\u00f0: Corde creditur ad iustitiam ore autem confessio fit in salutem. Mid\nSe godspellere s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t middangeard w\u00e6re gewriten \u00fea Crist w\u00e6s acenned.\nOn \u00fean w\u00e6s getacnod \u00fe\u00e6t he com on menniscum lichoman se wolde his \u00feara gecorenra naman\nCyrinus w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s caseres gerefa in \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e sio is nemned Syria.\n\u00c6rest manna he l\u00e6rde \u00feone casere & wi\u00f0 him ge\u00feeahtode \u00fe\u00e6t ealle men him sceoldon gafol gyldan,\nIn \u00f0am he getacnode \u00feone eadegan Petrus, Cristes aldor\u00feegn, for\u00feam\u00fee fram him com sio \u00e6reste\nSwa \u00feonne nu anra gehwylc eadiglice Gode agife\u00f0 rihtne geleafan \u00feonne he andette\u00f0 f\u00e6der & suna &\nUs is to witonne \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s geleaflice gestihtod \u00fe\u00e6t Ioseph for to Bethlem fram Galilea \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00fe\u00e6r\nRyhtlice sio stow w\u00e6s swa gelice naman genemned for\u00fean\u00fee on hire w\u00e6s acenned lifes hlaf se \u00f0e\nSo\u00f0lice he is se cwica hlaf for\u00fean\u00fee \u00e6lmihtig God he gefylle\u00f0 \u00fea cl\u00e6nan heortan & his \u00feara gecorenra\n\u00d0a Ioseph & Maria comon to Bethlem, \u00f0a w\u00e6s sancta Maria bearneacenu, nal\u00e6s fram Iosephe ac of\nUre h\u00e6lend Crist is nemned in \u00feam godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re sancta Marian frumbearn, nales \u00fe\u00e6t hio\nN\u00e6nig \u00e6r him of helle astah, ne \u00e6nig \u00e6r him of dea\u00f0e aras, \u00fe\u00e6t he eft ne sceolde dea\u00f0es byrgan.\n\u00de\u00e6t mon leorna\u00f0 on gewritum \u00fe\u00e6t monige arison of dea\u00f0e, hie sceoldon hw\u00e6\u00f0re eft dea\u00f0es byrgan\nWe gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t ure h\u00e6lend w\u00e6s on binne aseted \u00fea he w\u00e6s acenned.\n\u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s sio stow \u00fe\u00e6r man nytenum hira andlifan sealde.\nSio binne getacnode Godes wiofod, \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 \u00feam halgum nytenum, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feam geleaffulum mannum,\n\u00deas word us syndon swi\u00f0e to ongitanne \u00fe\u00e6tte we uncl\u00e6nlice ne onfon \u00feam halgan geryne Cristes\n& we hyrdon \u00e6r on \u00feam godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t hyrdas w\u00e6ron on \u00feam ilcan lande w\u00e6ccende, & bi him stod\n\u00dea hyrdas getacnodan \u00fea godan lareowas & gedefe aldoras \u00f0a \u00fee geornlice healda\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Cristes yrfe\n& gif hie arf\u00e6stlice healda\u00f0 & wel l\u00e6ra\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t geleaffulle Godes folc, \u00feonne bio\u00f0 hie rumlice onlyhte\n\u00d0a hyrdas him \u00fea ondredon swi\u00f0e, ac se engel hie frefrede & swa cw\u00e6\u00f0: Nolite timere. Ne \u00f0urfon ge\n\u00cbfne swa he cw\u00e6de: Micel is gefea, swa he n\u00e6fre ne bi\u00f0 geendod, ne he ne bi\u00f0 Iudeum anum seald, ac\nFor\u00f0an is gedafenlic \u00fe\u00e6t swa hwylc man swa wille gefean habban \u00fe\u00e6t he hine \u00f0yde to \u00f0am gefean se\nFor \u00feam gefean englas heredon dryhten & swa cw\u00e6don: Gloria in excelsis Deo. Wuldor sie on\n\u00c6r \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t ure h\u00e6lend w\u00e6re on menniscum lichoman acenned, \u00e6r we h\u00e6fdon \u00e6fre wonisse &\nFor\u00fean hie mannum budon sybbe & swa cw\u00e6don: Pax hominibus bone uoluntatis. Sibb sie mid\n\u00de\u00e6t is se goda willa \u00fe\u00e6t man o\u00f0rum \u00fe\u00e6s unne \u00fee he wille \u00fe\u00e6t him gelimpe, & \u00fe\u00e6t he on o\u00f0res\nH\u00e6bben we for \u00feam godne willan on ure heortan, for\u00fean\u00fee we ne bio\u00f0 \u00e6fre idele godra weorca for\nWe gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6tte ure h\u00e6lend h\u00e6fde mycle ea\u00f0modnesse.\nFor ure lufan he astah of heofonum on eor\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t we astigan fram eor\u00f0an to heofonum.\nHe w\u00e6s \u00feearfendlice mid cla\u00f0um bewunden \u00fe\u00e6t he us of synna bendum alysde.\nHe w\u00e6s on binne aseted on nearwe stowe & on medmicle \u00fe\u00e6t he us forgife wundoreardunge on\nFor\u00fean us gedafena\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we geornlice tiligen \u00e6r se bitra dea\u00f0 cyme, \u00fe\u00e6t we sien d\u00e6lnimende \u00fe\u00e6re\nNe geuncl\u00e6nsie us \u00e6nig fyrenlust, ne us to Gode wrege scandlic ge\u00feoht, ne ure mod gedrefan m\u00e6ge\nAc hergen we & wuldrien urne dryhten on cl\u00e6num ge\u00f0ohtum & on halgum wordum & on so\u00f0f\u00e6stum\nNe geneal\u00e6ce\u00f0 him n\u00e6nig yldo ne sorh ne sar ne dea\u00f0, ne his rices bi\u00f0 \u00e6fre \u00e6nig ende.\nAc he us eallum gife\u00f0, gif we geearnian willa\u00f0, rice butan ende & blisse butan gnornunge &\nGastlice herigen we ures dryhtnes naman, h\u00e6lendes Cristes; he leofa\u00f0 & ricsa\u00f0 aa butan ende.",
